OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to press ahead with market
OL,4,Aplace changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has approved changes to a
OL,7,F#4.5m regeneration scheme in
OL,8,FCleethorpes.
OL,10,FThe Market Place was originally set to
OL,11,Fbe pedestrianised, with most parking
OL,12,Fremoved, but plans were reviewed after
OL,13,FReform UK took control of North East
OL,14,FLincolnshire Council in May.
OL,16,FAt a cabinet meeting, councillors voted
OL,17,Fto proceed with revised proposals,
OL,18,Fincluding up to 12 seasonal parking
OL,19,Fbays, despite repeated calls from
OL,20,Fscrutiny councillors for a public
OL,21,Fconsultation.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
