OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to press ahead with market
OL,4,Aplace changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Oliver Freeston said
OL,7,Fcabinet members had considered the
OL,8,Fscrutiny panel's views but believed
OL,9,F"the public just want some clarity".
